Uses the official plugin background service and home widget interfaces.
Default port 5941; saved ports are preserved.
Supports account-scoped playback synchronization and a whole-book progress widget.
No BookOasis core source or DB schema changes are included.
Readest BookOasis b6 is a separate unofficial modified Android client,
with corresponding source and upstream notices supplied in the release.
The sample audio consists of original generated sine tones; no user audio,
production databases, credentials or signing keys are distributed.
